WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.600
Sit tall in an easy seat.

2
00:00:01.600 --> 00:00:03.200
Cross one arm under the other and wrap if comfortable.

3
00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:04.800
Lift elbows slightly and soften the shoulders.

4
00:00:04.800 --> 00:00:06.400
Breathe into the space between the shoulder blades.

5
00:00:06.400 --> 00:00:08.000
Switch the cross.
